$ ramplus profile show zswap-lz4
Profile: zswap-lz4 — zswap + lz4
zswap on: lz4, zsmalloc, pool up to 20% of RAM; sysctl as in default.

Status:   experimental: not confirmed by an SSD benchmark
Evidence: —
Where the values come from: Not confirmed by scripts/bench.sh on a real SSD (see CLAUDE.md). The --quick VM run (2026-11-17) is not used to choose values.

  PARAMETER                  VALUE      WHAT IT IS
  zswap.enabled              Y          zswap enabled
  zswap.compressor           lz4        compressor
  zswap.zpool                zsmalloc   pool allocator
  zswap.max_pool_percent     20         max pool, % of RAM
  zswap.shrinker_enabled     untouched  evict cold pages from the pool
  vm.swappiness              60         tendency to swap
  vm.page-cluster            3          swap readahead, 2^N pages
  vm.watermark_scale_factor  10         kswapd memory reserve, ‱
  vm.vfs_cache_pressure      100        dentry/inode cache reclaim

$ ramplus profile plan zswap-lz4 --verbose
Plan: profile zswap-lz4 — experimental: not confirmed by an SSD benchmark
Command: ramplus profile apply zswap-lz4
Profile: zswap + lz4. zswap on: lz4, zsmalloc, pool up to 20% of RAM; sysctl as in default.
Evidence: none (no scripts/bench.sh results on a real SSD)

Parameters
  PARAMETER         NOW     NEW       CURRENT SOURCE
  zswap.enabled     N    →  Y         kernel default
  zswap.compressor  lzo  →  lz4       kernel default
  zswap.zpool       —       zsmalloc  not in this kernel — skipped
  unchanged: zswap.max_pool_percent=20, vm.swappiness=60, vm.page-cluster=3, vm.watermark_scale_factor=10, vm.vfs_cache_pressure=100

Checks
  [ok]   root: running as root
  [warn] status: experimental profile: not confirmed by scripts/bench.sh on a real SSD — applied only with explicit confirmation (in scripts: --experimental)
  [info] zswap.zpool: this kernel has no zpool parameter: zsmalloc is used — skipped
  [info] original values: first profile apply: the current system values are saved to /var/lib/ramplus/state.json for ramplus profile reset

Steps
   1. zswap.compressor = lz4 (write to /sys/module/zswap/parameters/compressor)
   2. zswap.enabled = Y (write to /sys/module/zswap/parameters/enabled)
   3. write /etc/sysctl.d/99-ramplus.conf
      ┌── /etc/sysctl.d/99-ramplus.conf
      │ # Managed by RamPlus: do not edit, use `ramplus profile`.
      │ # Профиль: zswap-lz4 (экспериментальный: не подтверждён бенчмарком на SSD)
      │ # Применяется systemd-sysctl при загрузке; имя 99-ramplus.conf — чтобы идти после остальных.
      │ vm.swappiness = 60
      │ vm.page-cluster = 3
      │ vm.watermark_scale_factor = 10
      │ vm.vfs_cache_pressure = 100
      └──
   4. write /etc/systemd/system/ramplus-zswap.service
      ┌── /etc/systemd/system/ramplus-zswap.service
      │ # Managed by RamPlus: do not edit, use `ramplus profile`.
      │ # Профиль: zswap-lz4 (экспериментальный: не подтверждён бенчмарком на SSD)
      │ # Пишет параметры zswap при загрузке (kernel cmdline не меняется).
      │ [Unit]
      │ Description=RamPlus zswap parameters (profile zswap-lz4)
      │ Documentation=https://github.com/ashot0907/RamPlus
      │ DefaultDependencies=no
      │ After=local-fs.target systemd-modules-load.service
      │ Before=swap.target
      │ ConditionPathIsDirectory=/sys/module/zswap/parameters
      │ 
      │ [Service]
      │ Type=oneshot
      │ RemainAfterExit=yes
      │ ExecStart=/bin/sh -c 'echo lz4 > /sys/module/zswap/parameters/compressor'
      │ ExecStart=/bin/sh -c 'echo 20 > /sys/module/zswap/parameters/max_pool_percent'
      │ ExecStart=/bin/sh -c 'echo Y > /sys/module/zswap/parameters/enabled'
      │ 
      │ [Install]
      │ WantedBy=swap.target
      └──
   5. systemctl daemon-reload
   6. systemctl enable ramplus-zswap.service

Summary
  right away (runtime): parameters changed: 2
  created: /etc/sysctl.d/99-ramplus.conf, /etc/systemd/system/ramplus-zswap.service
  deleted: —
  kernel cmdline and GRUB: not changed

